sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as Learner
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant FB as Firebase Auth
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant M as Email Service

    L->>F: enters name, email, password
    F->>F: Validators.password - UX only
    F->>FB: createUserWithEmailAndPassword
    FB-->>F: UserCredential - uid, idToken, emailVerified false
    F->>FB: sendEmailVerification
    FB->>L: verification email with link

    Note over F,API: First authenticated request creates the Laravel row
    F->>API: GET /api/me + Bearer idToken
    API->>API: verify JWT signature, exp, aud, iss
    API->>DB: firstOrCreate by firebase_uid
    DB-->>API: user row - profile incomplete
    API-->>F: 200 - needs_onboarding true

    F->>L: Onboarding - grade, interests, avatar
    L->>F: selections
    F->>API: PATCH /api/me + Bearer idToken
    API->>DB: update profile, attach interests
    API-->>F: 200 - is_minor true

    alt learner is a minor
        F->>API: POST /api/guardian-consents
        API->>DB: insert guardian_consents, is_current true
        API->>M: queue consent email with signed token
        API-->>F: 202 accepted
        F->>L: ConsentPendingScreen
    else adult learner
        F->>L: AppShell - home
    end
